# khelp: every command in a picker, enter runs it
Output docs/khelp.gif
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1300
Set Height 680
Set Padding 18
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 80ms
Hide
Type "export PS1='demo $ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "khelp"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Down
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 700ms
Down
Sleep 1200ms
Type "logs"
Sleep 2500ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms
